SPL adoption (php-spl + php-ext-spl owners); needs vm-unserialize.diff. Nested legacy-format unserialization uses php_runtime::serialize::unserialize_partial on the whole buffer with the active unserialize() call's options: allowed_classes reaches ArrayObject contents (bug72785), failure offsets are php-src's and docref warnings name the method (bug73341); also forwards unserialize_enum_case.

diff --git a/crates/php-ext-spl/src/host.rs b/crates/php-ext-spl/src/host.rs
